    narr:generatedFrom "91a64595898d7daf51efb7ee046e6c9870fbba0f" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative holds the interview-flywheel motion: one expert conversation producing [three outputs at once — installable perspective, published content, live demo](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_4), framed as [a content flywheel that also builds marketplace supply](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_5). The origin runs through [Tanya's casual musing about packaging interviews as installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_7) and her [notion of seeding first modules with expertise from people she knows](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_34). A concrete first case follows: [Freya wanting to interview himself into an installable design-approach perspective](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_37), positioned as [one of the first marketplace perspectives](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_38), with [his immediate grasp of how the interview removes the expert's setup barrier](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_41). Execution surfaces include [the core insight that demo call, marketing content, and onboarding are the same event](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_3), [hosting/subdomain plans where the published version should feel like a media property](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_44), and [outreach templates committing to explicit free-vs-paid terms with no bait and switch](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_45). The arc runs from irrealis musing toward concrete, dated execution.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_3> ;
